            "source:0403949de98ba5f1302587ee"
          ],
          "text": "Grunt Ounda is a named grunt associated with protecting an airship on its route from Orgrimmar to Grom'gol base camp in Stranglethorn Vale. He describes the protection as a collective duty.",
